EXPLORATORY	Table A5	tablea5.earlier_holm	The number before the arrow is the earlier independent-proportion test. paired_tests.csv stores the paired Holm count only.
EXPLORATORY	Figure 4	fig4b.edge_0.38_to_1.30	results_summary.csv has no edge-aligned surname row that moves from 0.38 bits to 1.30 bits.
EXPLORATORY	Figure 5; Section 4.5	fig5.wordfreq_prior	s4_priors.csv is absent. test4 has a uniform prior, not the word-frequency or shuffled-census prior. 48.3%, 21.2% and 6.48 bits are not rebuilt.
EXPLORATORY	Figure 5	fig5.recalibrated_31	The form summary has Pillow-model exact hits of 0 and matched hits of 63. It has no 31/100 recalibrated cell.
EXPLORATORY	Section 5.3	own_height	The manuscript says the own-height variant is not reported. w1_pooled.csv is absent and no function keeps a box's own height.
EXPLORATORY	Figure 6; Table A7	form_pages	Form PDFs, scans and the LibreOffice profile are not in the repository. The score table is.
